    "inRelationships": "They build relationships through reliable, practical contribution to family and community, preferring roles of steady provider or trusted organizer over passionate romantic intensity. Both systems reinforce a deep, inward orientation toward personal meaning, producing someone whose identity is built from carefully tended inner values and an almost poetic relationship with their own emotional landscape.",
