    "stressBehavior": "Under stress, they retreat entirely, becoming absorbed in private suffering and cutting off connection. Under grip stress, inferior Fe erupts as uncharacteristic emotional volatility, tearfulness, or an urgent, clumsy attempt to reconnect with others.",
