    "portrait": "The 7w8 merges the Enthusiast’s appetite for experience with the Challenger’s boldness and assertion, creating a person of enormous energy, confidence, and appetite for life. They pursue pleasure, freedom, and impact with equal intensity and rarely back down from a challenge. They can be exhilarating to be around but may overwhelm others with the force of their will. ENTPs lead with extraverted Intuition, generating ideas and arguments at speed and finding genuine joy in intellectual combat and creative disruption. Their auxiliary Ti gives them enough analytical rigor to back their provocations, making them compelling debaters who rarely run out of angles. They are oriented toward group membership, social role, and being a reliable, respected presence in their community, offering care through consistent contribution rather than individual intensity.",
