    "instStack": "SP/SO/SX",
    "portrait": "The 7w8 merges the Enthusiast’s appetite for experience with the Challenger’s boldness and assertion, creating a person of enormous energy, confidence, and appetite for life. They pursue pleasure, freedom, and impact with equal intensity and rarely back down from a challenge. They can be exhilarating to be around but may overwhelm others with the force of their will. ISTJs lead with introverted Sensing, drawing on a comprehensive archive of past experience to evaluate present situations against proven standards. Their auxiliary Te drives them to apply this knowledge systematically and efficiently, making them reliable stewards of process, duty, and tradition. They build relationships through reliable, practical contribution to family and community, preferring roles of steady provider or trusted organizer over passionate romantic intensity.",
