    "portrait": "The 8w7 combines the Challenger’s raw power and protectiveness with the Enthusiast’s love of life and expansiveness, producing a charismatic force of nature who leads boldly and lives fully. They are magnetic, direct, and unafraid to seize opportunity, often pulling others into their wake. Their energy is high and their appetite for experience nearly insatiable. INFJs lead with introverted Intuition, absorbing patterns across time and converging them into deep convictions about how things will unfold. Their auxiliary Fe keeps them attuned to the emotional undercurrents in every room, making them quietly powerful empaths who think in systems but feel in people. They move between social investment and passionate one-on-one intensity, needing to feel both part of a meaningful community and deeply chosen by someone special within it.",
