    "inRelationships": "They move between social investment and passionate one-on-one intensity, needing to feel both part of a meaningful community and deeply chosen by someone special within it. The Eight’s drive for power and self-determination aligns naturally with the ENTJ’s Te-Ni command architecture, producing a leader of formidable vision, decisiveness, and strategic confidence.",
